{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02719",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.26,
      "end_seconds": 4.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.31,
      "end_seconds": 9.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.8,
      "end_seconds": 16.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "I've been dealing with stiff aching shoulders and hips."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.76,
      "end_seconds": 20.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.16,
      "end_seconds": 24.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "For six months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.29,
      "end_seconds": 27.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "What brings it on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.74,
      "end_seconds": 32.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Yes, mornings. That makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.02,
      "end_seconds": 37.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.88,
      "end_seconds": 43.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Maybe a five out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.54,
      "end_seconds": 46.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.33,
      "end_seconds": 55.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.88,
      "text": "Difficulty getting out of bed goes along with it, most of the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 55.78,
      "end_seconds": 65.26,
      "duration_seconds": 9.48,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Saturation 97 percent, BP is 112 over 82, temperature 36.5, pulse 85."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.1,
      "end_seconds": 68.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Alright, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.41,
      "end_seconds": 72.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.48,
      "end_seconds": 76.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Alright, does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.57,
      "end_seconds": 98.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.56,
      "text": "The shoulders are painful to move but strength is normal and there is no joint swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.67,
      "end_seconds": 110.19,
      "duration_seconds": 8.52,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. And what about visual changes, weight loss or jaw pain on chewing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.13,
      "end_seconds": 119.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "No, no visual changes, weight loss or jaw pain on chewing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.94,
      "end_seconds": 122.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Did you notice any headache?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.72,
      "end_seconds": 126.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Not at all, no headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.81,
      "end_seconds": 130.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.69,
      "end_seconds": 133.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.85,
      "end_seconds": 143.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.34,
      "end_seconds": 147.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.69,
      "end_seconds": 154.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Right, tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.98,
      "end_seconds": 169.72,
      "duration_seconds": 9.74,
      "text": "I swim twice a week. I grab fast food at lunch most days. My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.2,
      "end_seconds": 188.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Okay, what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.45,
      "end_seconds": 193.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "I have asthma, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.82,
      "end_seconds": 204.05,
      "duration_seconds": 9.23,
      "text": "Okay, I can see asthma in your file as well. Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.32,
      "end_seconds": 207.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Seretide inhaler, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.97,
      "end_seconds": 214.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.51,
      "end_seconds": 219.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "No, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.88,
      "end_seconds": 244.09,
      "duration_seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, it fits best with polymyalgia rheumatica. Rheumatoid arthritis is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.73,
      "end_seconds": 246.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.56,
      "end_seconds": 259.47,
      "duration_seconds": 11.91,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now polymyalgia rheumatica is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's get blood tests, for proximal stiffness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.1,
      "end_seconds": 262.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "How long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.19,
      "end_seconds": 286.08,
      "duration_seconds": 21.89,
      "text": "For this, prednisolone, 15 milligrams, once a day, reducing course. You take it by mouth. That should help with polymyalgia rheumatica. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. Report any headache or jaw pain immediately. Let's plan a check in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.32,
      "end_seconds": 288.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Yes, that's manageable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.9,
      "end_seconds": 294.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.91,
      "end_seconds": 297.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Thank you, um, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.37,
      "end_seconds": 302.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}